      "updated": 1794226774656,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AI research (Claude Haiku + web search - costs management)\n\nStandard Search: industry, locations, employees, funding, hiring.\n(Minimal Costs)\n\nUser requested Deep Research (more costly - higher capped amount):  \n• Industry & business model\n• Geographic footprint\n• Employee count\n• Funding & financials\n• Hiring trends\n• Direct travel indicators (business / local / unclear)\n• Recent expansion\n• Support complexity\nReuses what's already known; looks for stronger sources",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "re17",
      "originalText": "AI research (Claude Haiku + web search - costs management)\n\nStandard Search: industry, locations, employees, funding, hiring. (Minimal Costs)\n\nUser requested Deep Research (more costly - higher capped amount):  \n• Industry & business model\n• Geographic footprint\n• Employee count\n• Funding & financials\n• Hiring trends\n• Direct travel indicators (business / local / unclear)\n• Recent expansion\n• Support complexity\nReuses what's already known; looks for stronger sources",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "aH",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
